e Dean of Global Health Research\nPOINTS OF BLUE\nSee more Points of Blue Stories\nPOINTS OF BLUE\nNoah Carey, MD/MPH student: Connecting medicine, public health and purpose\nPOINTS OF BLUE\nJacob Mack: Helping Trainees Take the Next Step\nPOINTS OF BLUE\nJodi Ehrmann, MD: Shaping Growth, One Day at a Time\nWe transform lives through bold discovery, compassionate care and innovative education.\nMichigan Medicine\nAbout\nMission\nCommunity\nGiving\nNews & Stories\nPatient Care\nFind a Doctor\nPatient & Visitor Guide\nPatient Portal Login\nResearch\nClinical Trials\nResearch Labs\nResearch Centers\nCores and Resources\nEducation\nPrograms & Admissions\nOur Community\nDepartments, Centers & Offices\nAbout the Medical School\nIntranet\nYour gift changes lives. It\u2019s never been easier to make an impact.\nMake a Gift\nAccelerate your career. Advance world health.\nCareers at Michigan Medicine\nReport Sexual Misconduct, Discrimination and Harassment\u00a9 Copyright 1995-2026 Regents of the University of MichiganAccessibility StatementCommunication PreferencesDisclaimerInternet PrivacyPatient PrivacyU-M Non-DiscriminationDepartment of CommunicationHealth Information Technology & ServicesMichigan Medicine Finance\nJump back to top", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://medschool.umich.edu/#main-content"], ["About Michigan Medicine", "https://www.michiganmedicine.org"], ["Patient Care", "https://www.uofmhealth.org"], ["Research", "https://medresearch.umich.edu"], ["Education", "https://medschool.umich.edu"], ["Departments", "https://medschool.umich.edu/departments"], ["", "https://medschool.umich.edu/"], ["Programs & Admissions", "https://medschool.umich.edu/programs-admissions"], ["MD Program", "https://medschool.umich.edu/programs-admissions/md-program"], ["MD | PhD Program", "https://medschool.umich.edu/programs-admissions/md-phd-program"], ["Master's Programs", "https://medschool.umich.edu/programs-admissions/masters-programs"], ["PhD Programs", "https://medsch